Here, a DemoFunction-Single Managed Object Class (MOC) of the solution set is defined corresponding to the
DemoFunction Information Object Class (IOC) from the information model. A Managed Object Instance (MOI) of a
DemoFunction-Single will be a JSON object that conforms to the Top MOC (which defines the id naming attribute) and
will also contain an attributes property object. The attributes object conforms to the base class ManagedFunction-Attr
and also contains a set of properties defined for the DemoFunction including demoId, demoFlag, and exampleConf.
In addition to the attributes object, a DemoFunction-Single conforms to the the ManagedFunction-nc0 MOC and has
additional properties corresponding to the name-containment relations defined in the UML diagram for the
DemoFunction IOC, including multiple ChildClass and a single AnotherChildClass.
